Complete the hybrid query request body sent to POST https://{service}.search.windows.net/indexes/docs-index/docs/search?api-version=2026-04-01 so that it runs keyword plus vector search and reranks with the semantic ranker:

{
  "search": "warranty claim procedure",
  "vectorQueries": [
    { "kind": "[B1]", "vector": [ ... ], "k": [B2], "fields": "contentVector" }
  ],
  "top": 10,
  "queryType": "[B3]",
  "semanticConfiguration": "my-semantic-config"
}

Complete the JSON definition of a custom Azure Content Understanding analyzer that reads two values from scanned business cards:

{
  "description": "Simple business card",
  "baseAnalyzerId": "[B1]",
  "config": { "returnDetails": true },
  "fieldSchema": {
    "fields": {
      "ContactName": { "type": "string", "method": "[B2]", "description": "Name on business card" }
    }
  },
  "models": { "completion": "[B3]", "embedding": "text-embedding-3-large" }
}

Complete the Azure AI Search skillset entry that uses Azure Content Understanding to extract and chunk document content with page location metadata:

{
  "@odata.type": "[B1]",
  "context": "/document",
  "extractionOptions": ["images", "locationMetadata"],
  "chunkingProperties": { "unit": "characters", "maximumLength": 1325, "overlapLength": 0 },
  "inputs": [ { "name": "[B2]", "source": "/document/file_data" } ],
  "outputs": [
    { "name": "[B3]", "targetName": "text_sections" },
    { "name": "normalized_images", "targetName": "normalized_images" }
  ]
}
